Import the C function thrd_current taking no parameters, returning an unsigned long integer, from the header "threads.h".
Import the C function thrd_equal taking an unsigned long integer and an unsigned long integer, returning an integer, from the header "threads.h".
Declare me as unsigned long integer with value Call thrd_current done.
If Call thrd_equal with me, me done is not equal to 0 then: Say "same thread". End if.
